flowchart LR
    A[Authenticated upload] --> B[Validate type, signature, size, ownership]
    B --> C[Store under generated local name]
    C --> D[Enqueue document ID]
    D --> E[Technical PDF analysis]
    E --> F[Native PDF or DOCX extraction]
    E --> G[Select scanned PDF pages]
    G --> H[Local OCR]
    F --> I[Ordered raw sections]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Conservative normalization]
    J --> K[Document Understanding]
    K --> L[Token-aware chunking]
    J --> L
    L --> M[Batch embedding generation]
    M --> N[Transactional section, chunk, vector persistence]
    N --> O[Document Ready]

    E -. independent failure .-> F
    K -. non-fatal failure .-> L
    H -. partial OCR still yields usable pages .-> I

